<title>USA: Precision Systems names interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Precision Systems names interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Systems Inc said Friday it appointed Wim Huisman interim president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Huisman replaces Russell Pillar while the board seeks a permanent replacement.  Pillar announced his resignation September 18.</p>
<p>Huisman joined the company on June 1 as president of the company's Precision Systems International operations.</p>
<p>Pillar will continue to serve on the company's board of directors and as a consultant, Precision Systems said in a press release.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
